</did><scopecontent id="ref179">
<head>Scope and Content</head>
<p>This series contains the bulk of the collection and features original scores composed by Eugester throughout his career. Some of the materials include songs from Alice in Wonderland, A Christmas Carol, Turnabout, Hurly Burly, and the Tarot Suite. Scores include arrangements for various instruments.</p>
